<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not fully established -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not fully established -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not fully established on a carcass basis, compared with Tuesday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Steers:  Select to mostly Choice 1200-1250 lb pt ld 103.00 ld 103.50. Heifers:  Select to mostly Choice 1100-1150 lb  few 103.00. Reported sales for Wednesday: 300.  Week to Date: 14,900</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
